Dialogue: 50,0:01:54.89,0:01:56.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,O-O çocuk...
Dialogue: 50,0:01:56.85,0:01:59.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kaptan Kuro'nun kedi pençesini kırdı!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:02.35,0:02:05.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Şu tuhaf kılıçlarından\Nsadece beş tane kaldı.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:08.86,0:02:11.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sorun yok! Hâlâ dövüşebilir!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:11.07,0:02:13.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Evet! Diğer pençesi hâlâ duruyor!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:13.57,0:02:16.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,O herifi doğra, Kaptan Kuro!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:16.70,0:02:19.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey! O isim yasaklı!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:19.83,0:02:23.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Buralarda Klaha bilmem ne diye\Nbilindiğinden eminim...
Dialogue: 50,0:02:23.54,0:02:25.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kla-{\i1}san{\i0}, diyelim!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:25.67,0:02:28.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– Kla-{\i1}san{\i0}! Hakla onu!\N– Kla-{\i1}san{\i0}! Hakla onu!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:30.13,0:02:31.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Lanet çenenizi...
Dialogue: 50,0:02:32.38,0:02:33.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,kapatın lan!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:39.35,0:02:41.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Çıkın ortaya, sizi bücürler!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:41.72,0:02:44.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Orada saklandığınızı biliyorum!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:44.35,0:02:45.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Pes edin artık!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:48.69,0:02:50.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bu tarafa!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:50.15,0:02:52.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Seni doğruca Kaya-{\i1}san{\i0}'a götüreceğiz!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:55.11,0:03:00.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Cidden o kadar enayi miyim? Sanki\Nsiz veletlerin dediğine inanırım da!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:01.54,0:03:02.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ha?!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:05.58,0:03:07.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yakaladık!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:07.04,0:03:08.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Şimdi!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:10.55,0:03:11.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Al bakalım!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:11.55,0:03:13.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Toz Biber Saldırısı!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:29.98,0:03:32.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– İtin!\N– İtin!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:39.53,0:03:41.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ahhh!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:41.28,0:03:42.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ah! Ah!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:45.37,0:03:48.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– İşin bitti, hipnozcu!\N– İşin bitti, hipnozcu!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:53.71,0:03:56.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ukalalık etmeyin.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:57.34,0:03:59.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kahretsin! Başaramadık...!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:59.93,0:04:02.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Beni ciddiye almadınız.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:02.22,0:04:04.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sonuçta ben bir korsanım.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:07.14,0:04:08.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– Tamanegi!\N– Tamanegi!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:08.27,0:04:13.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Korsan taklidi yapan bebeler,\Nyanlış kişilere bulaştınız...
Dialogue: 50,0:04:16.90,0:04:19.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nerede saklanıyorsun, hanımefendi?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:19.28,0:04:22.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Önce bu üçünü öldüreceğim.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:22.78,0:04:26.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Gerçek korsanlara bulaşmanın bedelini...
Dialogue: 50,0:04:26.87,0:04:30.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,öbür dünyaya giderken anlayacaksınız.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:37.47,0:04:39.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,İşte oradasın.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:40.59,0:04:41.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yapmayın!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:41.89,0:04:43.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kaçın, Kaya-{\i1}san{\i0}!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:43.30,0:04:44.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:44.18,0:04:46.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Evet! Onların sesi!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:46.35,0:04:47.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,O taraftan mı?!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:49.06,0:04:54.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hepinizi daha sonra yok edeceğim.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:54.86,0:04:57.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Tabii Jango'yu da!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:57.78,0:05:00.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,N-Niye ki?!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:00.61,0:05:03.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Lütfen şaka yapmayı bırakın,\NKaptan Kuro!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:04.12,0:05:07.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Köye saldırmak için\Nhâlâ geç kalmadık, değil mi?!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:07.50,0:05:12.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kaptan Jango da istediğiniz vasiyeti yazdırırsa, planınız başarılı olacak!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:13.84,0:05:17.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Artık plan için\Nendişelenmenize gerek yok.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:17.00,0:05:22.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Cesetleriniz burada olduğu sürece,\Nmasumiyetimi kanıtlayabilirim.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:23.34,0:05:27.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Zaten başından beri bu köyden\Nayrılmanızı planlamamıştım.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:28.39,0:05:34.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Gerçek kimliğimi bilen kimsenin\Nyaşamasına izin veremem.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:34.61,0:05:35.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Olamaz!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:35.57,0:05:39.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yani çoktan hepimizi\Nöldürmeyi planladınız mı?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:41.40,0:05:43.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Aynen öyle...
Dialogue: 50,0:05:44.03,0:05:49.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bunu üç yıl önce,\Nhâlâ Kaptan Kuro’yken planlamıştım.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:49.45,0:05:51.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hepsi...
Dialogue: 50,0:05:52.08,0:05:54.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hepsi planımın bir parçası!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:56.59,0:05:58.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hepiniz aptalsınız.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:58.80,0:06:01.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Korsan tayfanız o kadar vasat ki!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:02.13,0:06:03.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,"Vasat" mı?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:03.89,0:06:09.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Korsan tayfaları, medeni toplumlar için\Nuygun olmayan bir köpek sürüsüdür.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:09.43,0:06:12.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Çobansız bir sürü ne yapabilir ki?!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:12.52,0:06:16.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Herkes çenesini kapatıp emirlerime uymalı!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:17.57,0:06:21.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Tayfa üyeleri,\Nbir kaptanın sadık piyonlarıdır!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:21.11,0:06:25.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yaşamaları veya ölmeleri bana kalmış!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:25.03,0:06:29.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Karşılarına ne engel çıkarsa çıksın,\Ndimdik durup...
Dialogue: 50,0:06:29.83,0:06:33.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,planıma uygun şekilde\Ngebermeleri gerek.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:34.87,0:06:37.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Korsan olmak budur!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:37.71,0:06:40.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bana vaaz vermeye kalkma,\Nseni başıboş köpek!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:45.93,0:06:47.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Senin gibi bir kaptanın...
Dialogue: 50,0:06:48.26,0:06:51.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,yüzlerce hatta binlerce adamı olsa bile...
Dialogue: 50,0:06:52.52,0:06:55.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Usopp kadar taşaklı olamazsın!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:57.23,0:06:59.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ne dedin?!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:59.73,0:07:03.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,O kaptan bozması\Nbenden daha taşaklı mı?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:03.86,0:07:04.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kesinlikle!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:07.24,0:07:09.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ne kadar komiksin!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:09.12,0:07:13.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Pençelerimden birini kırdın diye\Nkendini bir şey sanma!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:13.54,0:07:15.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nasıl daha taşaklıymış?!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:16.17,0:07:17.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Söylesene!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:22.13,0:07:23.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Karakteriyle.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:24.47,0:07:25.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ne?!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:25.84,0:07:31.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Gerçek bir korsan olmanın\Nmanasını bilmiyorsun!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:42.27,0:07:43.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,O-O...
Dialogue: 50,0:07:43.99,0:07:47.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,"Kedi Yürüyüşü"nün hızına yetişebiliyor!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:49.91,0:07:52.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bu ne cüret...
Dialogue: 50,0:07:54.83,0:08:00.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Gerçek korsanlardan konuşmak\Nistiyorsan, sana onların dehşetini...
Dialogue: 50,0:08:00.79,0:08:03.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,göstereyim!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:03.75,0:08:09.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ölümle sayısız kez karşılaşmış bir\Nkorsanın dehşetine şahit olacaksın!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:14.52,0:08:17.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey! O duruş! Yoksa...?!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:17.23,0:08:19.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Onu mu kullanacak?!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:19.23,0:08:21.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ama sadece biriyle dövüşüyor!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:21.65,0:08:23.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kesinlikle yapacak!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:23.44,0:08:26.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,"Ölüm Kapanı"nı kullanacak!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:28.28,0:08:29.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Burada tehlikede değil miyiz?!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:29.91,0:08:31.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bizi de haklayacak!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:31.28,0:08:33.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Zaten bizi öldüreceğini planlamış!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:33.03,0:08:34.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Önceden söyledi!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:35.45,0:08:36.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Lütfen durun, Kaptan Kuro!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:36.95,0:08:38.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bu şekilde olmasın!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:38.50,0:08:40.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ne isterseniz yaparız!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:40.25,0:08:43.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yalvarıyoruz, Kaptan Kuro!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:43.00,0:08:44.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ne olabilir ki?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:45.09,0:08:47.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sadece sağa sola sallanıyor...
Dialogue: 50,0:08:47.80,0:08:50.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– Lütfen durun, Kaptan Kuro!\N– Lütfen durun, Kaptan Kuro!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:50.97,0:08:52.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Ölüm Kapanı!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:02.44,0:09:04.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bu nasıl ganimet...
Dialogue: 50,0:09:04.65,0:09:07.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bundan daha fazla\Nhazineleri olacağını düşünmüştüm.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:08.44,0:09:11.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bakalım, dövüş bitti mi?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:13.16,0:09:14.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ne?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:14.49,0:09:16.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kimse kıpırdamıyor.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:16.24,0:09:17.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yoksa bitti mi?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:25.75,0:09:26.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Orada!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:28.21,0:09:30.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,N-Nasıl orada olabilir?!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:33.14,0:09:34.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yine!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:36.22,0:09:37.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Şimdi de kaya!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:43.60,0:09:46.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Lütfen kesin şunu, Kaptan Kuro!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:46.07,0:09:49.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Faydasız! "Kedi Yürüyüşü" saldırıları\Nkontrolden çıktı!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:49.03,0:09:52.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,O kadar hızlı hareket ediyor ki\Nneyi kestiğinden bihaber!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:53.53,0:09:56.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Şimdiden birçok adamını biçt–
Dialogue: 50,0:09:57.16,0:09:58.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:03.54,0:10:06.04,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,N-Neler oluyor?!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:06.04,0:10:08.55,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Aniden doğranmaya başladılar!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:23.06,0:10:24.44,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Göster kendini...
Dialogue: 50,0:10:25.02,0:10:25.90,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,uşak...
Dialogue: 50,0:10:39.03,0:10:43.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Tayfanı hiç mi umursamıyorsun?!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:46.25,0:10:47.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy...
Dialogue: 50,0:11:13.32,0:11:14.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Buldum seni!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:15.40,0:11:16.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sinsi piç!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:16.91,0:11:19.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,İyi bir çocuk gibi\Nuslu uslu durmalıydın!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:19.74,0:11:20.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bak!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:20.87,0:11:26.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Senin yüzünden, sevgili adamlarım\Nyarı ölü hâlde.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:26.42,0:11:30.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Onları öldürmeme izin verseydin,\Ndaha insancıl olurdu!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:33.05,0:11:35.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Şimdi ne var?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:35.13,0:11:37.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bir şey mi söyleyeceksin?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:37.22,0:11:38.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Evet...
Dialogue: 50,0:11:38.43,0:11:40.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Asla senin gibi...
Dialogue: 50,0:11:42.10,0:11:44.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,bir adam olmayacağım.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:44.14,0:11:46.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Olmayacağından değil.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:48.10,0:11:51.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Zaten olamazsın.\NBu yetenekle olmaz.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:54.40,0:11:55.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ne fark eder ki,
Dialogue: 50,0:11:56.53,0:11:58.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,nasılsa burada öleceksin.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:00.07,0:12:02.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Lütfen kesin şunu!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:02.33,0:12:04.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Onları rahat bırak!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:04.95,0:12:06.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Vasiyeti yazacağım.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:06.79,0:12:08.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,H-Hayır!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:08.58,0:12:12.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yazdığınız zaman, sizi öldürecek!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:12.00,0:12:15.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Aptal. Benimle müzakere yapma.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:15.84,0:12:19.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kaptan Kuro hepinizi öldürmemi istedi.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:19.55,0:12:20.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Olamaz!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:28.64,0:12:32.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Dediğimi yap, yoksa canıma kıyarım!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:32.65,0:12:33.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Vasiyet de olmaz!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:33.98,0:12:35.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,H-Hayır, hayır! D-Dur... dur!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:35.94,0:12:36.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Aceleci davranma!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:37.32,0:12:40.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,O vasiyeti kesinlikle yazmalısın!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:41.62,0:12:43.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,K-Kaya-{\i1}san{\i0}!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:45.87,0:12:48.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,İyi be! Veletler gidebilir!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:48.54,0:12:52.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Gerçi kaçacak durumda değiller...
Dialogue: 50,0:12:55.92,0:12:57.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hemen imzala!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:57.46,0:12:58.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Peki...
Dialogue: 50,0:13:02.09,0:13:05.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,"Tüm servetimi\Nuşağım Klahadore'a bırakıyorum."
Dialogue: 50,0:13:05.89,0:13:06.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Mükemmel!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:06.97,0:13:08.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Görev tamamlandı!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:08.85,0:13:11.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Seni hipnotize etmeme bile\Ngerek kalmadı!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:12.86,0:13:16.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Onları öldürmeyeceğine\Nsöz verdin, tamam mı?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:18.32,0:13:19.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Endişelenme.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:19.82,0:13:23.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Öyle görünmeyebilirim ama\Nsözümün eriyimdir.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:23.28,0:13:25.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– Kaya-{\i1}san{\i0}!\N– Kaya-{\i1}san{\i0}!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:26.54,0:13:27.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,İşte oradalar!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:27.83,0:13:31.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oradalar! Oradalar! Dur!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:27.83,0:13:29.91,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,Ahhh! Ah, ah, ah!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:29.91,0:13:31.79,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,Yarama vuruyorsun!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:31.79,0:13:33.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Orada!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:35.34,0:13:36.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Tamam, sıra bende!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:36.42,0:13:37.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:38.01,0:13:40.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Buraya kadar, seni hipnozcu ucube!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:41.59,0:13:43.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Peşimden mi gelmiş?!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:49.56,0:13:54.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bunu hemen bitirsem iyi olacak!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:58.69,0:14:01.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Seninle yeterince oynadım.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:02.82,0:14:04.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Özel ilgi vakti.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:06.12,0:14:11.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Seni dehşetle marine edip,\Nözenle servis edeceğim!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:14.33,0:14:15.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Ölüm Kapanı!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:37.23,0:14:39.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Şimdi kaçta görelim!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:39.02,0:14:41.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kahretsin! Çekil üstümden!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:41.65,0:14:45.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Şimdi üç yıllık planın\Ntam bir fiyasko oldu!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:45.95,0:14:47.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ne?!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:47.45,0:14:50.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kaptan Kuro'yu yakaladı!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:50.91,0:14:55.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kazanırsa belki de öldürülmeyiz, değil mi?!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:57.88,0:15:00.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ölme vakti!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:00.21,0:15:02.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,İzin vermeyeceğiz!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:07.97,0:15:11.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Lanet olası bücürler!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:13.81,0:15:15.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Geç kaldın, kuşaklı adam!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:15.89,0:15:17.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Emin misin?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:21.15,0:15:24.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Evet! O dal görüşümü kapatıyordu!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:25.24,0:15:26.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ne?!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:26.32,0:15:27.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Usopp-{\i1}san{\i0}...
Dialogue: 50,0:15:28.24,0:15:29.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– Kaptan!\N– Kaptan!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:30.37,0:15:32.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Al bakalım, seni hipnozcu!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:32.62,0:15:34.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hakla onu, lastik adam!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:34.91,0:15:36.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kaptan Kuro'nun kıçını tekmele!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:37.42,0:15:38.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bırak!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:39.79,0:15:44.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Siz, benim için tezahürat yapmayın!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:45.01,0:15:46.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bırak dedim!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:46.80,0:15:49.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Lastik-Lastik...
Dialogue: 50,0:15:50.18,0:15:52.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Ölümcül Patlayan Yıldız!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:56.39,0:16:03.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fad(150,0)\t(5521,0,1,\c&HF8F8F8&\3c&HF8F8F8&\4c&HF8F8F8&)}...Çan!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:55.56,0:15:57.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Planım...
Dialogue: 50,0:15:57.44,0:16:03.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\t(4481,0,1,\c&HF8F8F8&\3c&HF8F8F8&\4c&HF8F8F8&)}Planım başarısız olmayacak!!!
